# =========================
# Firebase / FCM Secrets
# =========================
# FCM service-account private keys must
# remain in EAS credentials, never in Git.
#
# google-services.json is deliberately NOT
# ignored because EAS builds require it
# for Android push notifications.

*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
firebase-service-account*.json

